  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DoctorHelp.NpcDialogueAsset
  content: "I went to bed shivering and woke up drenched through.\nThe room is cold enough to see my breath, but my forehead feels like a stove.\nI've put off two deliveries waiting for it to pass."
